  (:NAME "STRING-NOT-EQUAL" :KIND :FUNCTION :LAMBDA-LIST "(string1 string2 &key (start1 0) end1 (start2 0) end2)" :DOCSTRING "Given two strings, if the first string is not lexicographically equal
